#     borrowck-borrowed-uniq-rvalue      `&*Box::new(1)` in argument position
#     borrowed-temporary-error--t08      `&(v,)` in a block tail passed to a fn
#     issue-54382-use-span-of-tail-of-block  `D(3).next(&_thing1).end()` in a tail
